        <p>From Noi Bai Airport to central Hanoi, use Google Maps to find your route. Key lines include 86, 68, 07, 17, 109, 90, E10, NB01, NB02. Fares run 14,000–50,000 VND, operating roughly 05:00–22:30.</p>
